Carl,
Are you just looking for the following syntax?

dt[a<35 & b>35, lapply(.SD, median, na.rm = T), by = d]

You can include as many conditions as necessary in `i`. You can also 
chain data.tables:

dt[a<35][b>35][, lapply(.SD, median, na.rm = T), by = d]

--Mel.

